<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><title>Quickshare · 发布，然后分享</title><meta name="description" content="把 AI 做好的作品，变成一个随时能打开的链接。支持 HTML、Markdown 和静态网站，在与 Agent 的对话中完成发布与更新。"><% if(isHome){ %><%- include("social-meta", {title:"Quickshare · 发布，然后分享",description:"把 AI 做好的作品，变成一个随时能打开的链接。",canonical:baseUrl+"/"}) %><% } %><link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.svg?v=<%= portalVersion %>"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/portal.css?v=<%= portalVersion %>"><script src="/assets/portal.js?v=<%= portalVersion %>" defer></script><script src="/assets/sharing.js?v=<%= portalVersion %>" defer></script></head>
<body><header class="top"><a class="brand" href="/"><%- include('brand') %></a><nav><a href="/publish">使用指南</a><button id="join-button" hidden>有邀请码</button><button id="login-button" class="login-button" hidden>登录</button><button id="account-button" hidden>账号</button><button id="logout" hidden>退出</button></nav></header>
<main id="main"><noscript><p class="error">发布控制台需要启用 JavaScript。你也可以<a href="/publish">查看 CLI 安装说明</a>。</p></noscript>
<section id="welcome" <%= isHome ? "" : "hidden" %>>
  <div class="welcome-copy">
    <div class="share-sculpture" aria-hidden="true"><div class="sculpture-orbit"></div><span class="paper paper-back"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"><path d="M5 7h14M5 12h14M5 17h9"/></svg></span><span class="paper paper-front"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><path d="m8 8-4 4 4 4m8-8 4 4-4 4m-3-11-2 22"/></svg></span><span class="share-stamp"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="m10 13 4-4m-6 6-1 1a4 4 0 0 1-6-6l4-4a4 4 0 0 1 6 0m2 3 1-1a4 4 0 0 1 6 6l-4 4a4 4 0 0 1-6 0"/></svg></span></div>
    <h1><span>做好了，</span><span>就分享。</span></h1>
    <p class="intro">把 AI 做好的作品，<br class="mobile-break">变成一个随时能打开的链接。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><%- include('agent-button') %><a class="secondary-button" href="/dashboard">直接上传文件 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg></a></div>
    <p class="hero-caption">支持 Codex · Claude Code · Cursor</p>

  </div>
</section>
<section id="workspace" hidden><div class="workspace-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow" id="greeting">你的发布空间</p><h1>发布，然后分享。</h1></div><button id="invite-button" class="primary" hidden>邀请朋友 <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div>
<div class="library-head"><div class="tabs"><button class="tab active" data-tab="sites">我的内容 <span id="site-count">0</span></button><button class="tab" data-tab="guide">安装与 CLI</button><button class="tab" id="members-tab" data-tab="members" hidden>朋友</button></div><input id="search" type="search" aria-label="搜索我的内容" placeholder="搜索内容…"></div>
<div class="workspace-agent"><div><h2>让 Agent 帮你发布</h2><p>在创作的对话里，直接获取分享链接。</p></div><%- include('agent-button', {compact: true}) %></div>
<section class="publish-box" aria-labelledby="publish-heading"><div id="dropzone" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="选择要发布的文件，也可以拖入文件或文件夹"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="32" height="32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 16V3m-5 5 5-5 5 5M4 15v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h14a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-5"/></svg><h2 id="publish-heading">或者，把文件放到这里</h2><p>HTML、Markdown，或一个网站文件夹</p><span class="drop-link">选择文件</span></div><div class="upload-options"><button id="choose-folder">选择文件夹</button><span>最多 100 个文件 · 合计 8 MB</span></div><input id="file-input" type="file" multiple hidden><input id="folder-input" type="file" webkitdirectory multiple hidden>
<form id="publish-form" hidden><div class="file-summary"><span id="file-summary"></span><button id="clear-files" type="button">取消</button></div><label>标题<input name="title" required maxlength="100" placeholder="给它起个名字"></label><details id="publish-link-settings"><summary>链接设置（可选）</summary><label>自定义地址<input name="slug" pattern="[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*" maxlength="64" placeholder="留空，自动生成"></label><p class="hint">地址发布后固定，修改标题不会改变链接。</p></details><label class="check"><input name="listed" type="checkbox">同时展示到作品展厅</label><div class="publish-bottom"><span class="hint">发布后，任何拿到链接的人都能打开。</span><button class="primary" id="publish-submit">发布并获取链接 ↗</button></div><p id="publish-error" class="error" role="alert"></p></form>
<div id="publish-success" hidden><span class="success-mark">✓ 发布成功</span><a id="published-url" target="_blank" rel="noopener"></a><button id="copy-published">复制链接</button><button id="publish-another">继续发布</button></div></section>

<section id="sites-panel"><div id="owner-filter" hidden><span id="owner-filter-label"></span><button id="clear-owner-filter">查看全部</button></div><p id="loading">正在读取内容…</p><div id="site-list"></div><div id="empty" class="empty" hidden><h3>下一个链接，从这里开始。</h3><p>发布一个文件，就会出现在这里。</p></div></section>
<section id="guide-panel" class="guide" hidden><h2>在你创作的地方，直接发布。</h2><p>复制安装 Prompt，发给你正在用的 AI 助手。</p><%- include('agent-button') %><details class="prompt-details"><summary>查看安装 Prompt</summary><pre id="agent-prompt"><%= agentPrompt %></pre></details><p>或者下载 CLI，使用账号里生成的专属令牌登录。</p><a class="text-link" href="/client/quickshare.js" download="quickshare.js">下载 CLI 脚本 ↓</a><pre id="cli-example"></pre><p class="hint">网站文件夹以 index.html 或 index.md 为首页。静态页面支持相对路径资源；服务端代码需要另行部署。</p></section>
<section id="members-panel" hidden aria-label="朋友列表"><p id="friends-error" class="error" role="alert"></p><table class="friends-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">朋友备注</th><th scope="col">状态</th><th scope="col">作品</th><th scope="col"><span class="visually-hidden">操作</span></th></tr></thead><tbody id="member-list"></tbody></table><div id="friends-empty" class="empty" hidden><h3>邀请朋友，一起分享。</h3><p>生成一份邀请 Prompt，朋友交给 Agent 即可开始。</p></div></section>
</section><p id="global-error" class="error" role="alert"></p></main>
<%- include('footer') %><dialog id="auth-dialog" class="auth-card" aria-labelledby="auth-title"><div class="dialog-head"><h2 id="auth-title">欢迎回来</h2><button data-close aria-label="关闭登录">×</button></div><form id="auth-form" data-mode="login"><label id="join-field" hidden>邀请码<input id="join-code" autocomplete="off" maxlength="300" placeholder="输入邀请码或粘贴邀请链接"></label><div id="auth-credentials"><label>用户名<input name="username" autocomplete="username" pattern="[a-z][a-z0-9_-]{2,29}" required maxlength="30" placeholder="你的用户名"></label><label>密码<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required minlength="12" maxlength="200" placeholder="至少 12 位"></label></div><p id="auth-error" class="error" role="alert"></p><button class="primary full" id="auth-submit">登录</button></form><div id="invite-agent" hidden><span class="auth-divider">或者交给 Agent</span><button type="button" class="secondary-button full" data-copy-agent data-invite-agent>复制邀请 Prompt <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p class="hint">Agent 会完成安装与连接，无须注册。</p><p id="invite-copy-status" class="hint" role="status"></p></div><button id="auth-switch" class="auth-switch">有邀请码？直接开始</button></dialog>

<%- include('agent-prompt') %>
<div id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
<dialog id="detail-dialog"><div class="dialog-head"><h2 id="detail-title">管理内容</h2><button data-close aria-label="关闭">×</button></div><a id="detail-url" class="detail-url" target="_blank" rel="noopener"></a><div class="detail-actions"><button id="update-files">更新文件</button><button id="toggle-listed"></button><button id="toggle-published"></button></div><%- include("sharing") %><h3>版本历史</h3><p class="hint">恢复旧内容会生成新版本，链接与当前展示设置保留。</p><div id="version-list"></div><p class="dialog-error error" role="alert"></p></dialog>
<dialog id="invite-dialog" aria-labelledby="invite-title"><div class="dialog-head"><h2 id="invite-title">邀请朋友</h2><button data-close aria-label="关闭邀请">×</button></div><form id="invite-form"><label>朋友备注<input name="label" required maxlength="60" placeholder="例如：小林" autocomplete="off"></label><button class="primary">生成并复制</button><p class="hint">一人一次，7 天有效。备注仅你可见。</p></form><div id="invite-result" hidden><p id="invite-result-message" role="status">邀请已生成</p><p id="invite-result-help" class="hint">把这段 Prompt 发给朋友，他交给 Agent 即可开始。</p><button id="copy-invite-prompt" class="primary full">复制邀请 Prompt</button><details id="invite-alternative"><summary>也可以发送邀请链接</summary><input id="invite-url" readonly aria-label="邀请链接"><button id="copy-invite">复制邀请链接</button></details><details id="invite-manual"><summary>查看 Prompt</summary><textarea id="invite-prompt-value" readonly aria-label="邀请 Prompt"></textarea></details></div><p class="dialog-error error" role="alert"></p></dialog>
<dialog id="note-dialog" aria-labelledby="note-title"><div class="dialog-head"><h2 id="note-title">修改朋友备注</h2><button data-close aria-label="关闭备注">×</button></div><form id="note-form"><label>朋友备注<input name="note" required maxlength="60" autocomplete="off"></label><button class="primary">保存备注</button></form><p class="dialog-error error" role="alert"></p></dialog>
<dialog id="account-dialog"><div class="dialog-head"><h2>账号设置</h2><button data-close aria-label="关闭">×</button></div><p id="account-name"></p><form id="password-form"><label id="register-name">用户名<input name="username" required pattern="[a-z][a-z0-9_-]{2,29}" maxlength="30" autocomplete="username" placeholder="3–30 位小写字母、数字或下划线"></label><label>设置新密码<input name="password" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="200" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="留空则保留当前密码"></label><p class="hint">改密码会退出其他网页登录，已连接的 Agent 不受影响。</p><button class="primary" id="account-save">保存账号</button></form><hr><h3>CLI 令牌</h3><p class="hint">生成后仅展示一次。重新生成会断开此前所有 Agent 和 CLI 连接。</p><button id="new-key">生成我的令牌</button><div id="key-result" hidden><input id="key-value" readonly type="password" aria-label="CLI 令牌"><button id="copy-key">复制令牌</button></div><p class="dialog-error error" role="alert"></p></dialog>
<dialog id="confirm-dialog"><h2 id="confirm-title"></h2><p id="confirm-description"></p><div class="confirm-actions"><button id="confirm-cancel">取消</button><button class="primary" id="confirm-ok">确认</button></div></dialog>
</body></html>
